{"id":"e29c92ba515d8b86","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-quotient-type.md","title":"df-quotient-type","display":"df-quotient-type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-quotient-type","aliases":["16-df-quotient-type","Quotient types"],"display":"df-quotient-type","depends_on":["[[16-df-eq-fibration]]","[[16-df-internal-equality]]"],"source":"Definition4.8.1 and Lemma4.8.2 pp.291–293 (PDF311–313); §4.7 pp.283–284 (PDF303–304)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-quotient-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-quotient-type</span><span>Quotient types</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quotient-type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"478c99d853e13c93\" href=\"?note=478c99d853e13c93\" title=\"16-df-eq-fibration\">16-df-eq-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"93b3305f115fb8fd\" href=\"?note=93b3305f115fb8fd\" title=\"16-df-internal-equality\">16-df-internal-equality</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition4.8.1 and Lemma4.8.2 pp.291–293 (PDF311–313); §4.7 pp.283–284 (PDF303–304)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"478c99d853e13c93\" href=\"?note=478c99d853e13c93\" title=\"16-df-eq-fibration\">16-df-eq-fibration</a> 的 Eq-fibration，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_I=\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1,\\pi_2)\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}\">\\(e_I=\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1,\\pi_2)\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"93b3305f115fb8fd\" href=\"?note=93b3305f115fb8fd\" title=\"16-df-internal-equality\">16-df-internal-equality</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}\\)</span> 是任意二元谓词，未预设为等价关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:I\\to Q\">\\(q:I\\to Q\\)</span> 为基范畴箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)\">\\(\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)\\)</span> 是下文定义的逻辑商泛性质；在该谓词的参数中显式保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,R,Q,q\">\\(I,R,Q,q\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotType}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotType}(p)\\)</span> 指每个二元谓词均有此商。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ker}_p(u:I\\to J)&amp;\\coloneqq(u\\times u)^*e_J,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\le_{I\\times I}\\mathsf{Ker}_p(q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J))\n\\bigl[R\\le_{I\\times I}\\mathsf{Ker}_p(u)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal B(Q,J))\\ hq=u\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{QuotType}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times I})\n(\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\exists q\\in\\mathcal B(I,Q))\\\n\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ker}_p(u:I\\to J)&amp;\\coloneqq(u\\times u)^*e_J,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\le_{I\\times I}\\mathsf{Ker}_p(q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J))\n\\bigl[R\\le_{I\\times I}\\mathsf{Ker}_p(u)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal B(Q,J))\\ hq=u\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{QuotType}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times I})\n(\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\exists q\\in\\mathcal B(I,Q))\\\n\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definition4.8.1 p.292 (PDF312) 用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eq}:\\mathcal B\\to\\mathrm{Rel}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathrm{Eq}:\\mathcal B\\to\\mathrm{Rel}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> 的左伴随定义quotient types，Lemma4.8.2(ii) pp.292–293 (PDF312–313) 给出这里逐对象的同一泛性质。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 的泛性质，其对关系态射的作用由唯一因子诱导，所以逐对象表述等价于该伴随。</p>\n<p>原稿把商放在预序纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_I\">\\(\\mathcal E_I\\)</span> 内；该位置只有退化的内部等价关系，无法解释本书的类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I/R\">\\(I/R\\)</span>。正确的商位于基范畴，关系在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\times I\">\\(I\\times I\\)</span> 上。§4.7 pp.283–284 (PDF303–304) 明确允许任意关系，full/effective quotients 才另要求等价关系与核关系对应。原稿额外的任意重索引稳定条件既未绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>，也不是 Definition4.8.1，故按原书纠正，而不是声称完成了依赖商语法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-eq-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"478c99d853e13c93","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-eq-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-internal-equality","status":"resolved","id":"93b3305f115fb8fd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-internal-equality]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"478c99d853e13c93","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为 [[16-df-eq-fibration]] 的 Eq-fibration，$e_I=\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1,\\pi_2)\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}$ 采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]。$R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}$ 是任意二元谓词，未预设为等价关系。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-internal-equality","status":"resolved","id":"93b3305f115fb8fd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为 [[16-df-eq-fibration]] 的 Eq-fibration，$e_I=\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1,\\pi_2)\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}$ 采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]。$R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}$ 是任意二元谓词，未预设为等价关系。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"e_I=\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1,\\pi_2)\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"q:I\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)","display":false},{"tex":"I,R,Q,q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuotType}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ker}_p(u:I\\to J)&\\coloneqq(u\\times u)^*e_J,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\le_{I\\times I}\\mathsf{Ker}_p(q)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J))\n\\bigl[R\\le_{I\\times I}\\mathsf{Ker}_p(u)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal B(Q,J))\\ hq=u\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{QuotType}(p)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times I})\n(\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\exists q\\in\\mathcal B(I,Q))\\\n\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eq}:\\mathcal B\\to\\mathrm{Rel}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"I/R","display":false},{"tex":"I\\times I","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":2362,"backlinks":[{"id":"e87d65e94fa4321e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 是 Eq-fibration；$I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$、$R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}$。$q:I\\to Q$、$q':I\\to Q'$ 使用 [[16-df-quotient-type]] 的 $\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)$。$\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-310","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-quotient-type|df-quotient-type]]"},{"id":"99b118717f09b9db","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为 Eq-fibration，$\\mathrm{QuotType}$、$\\mathsf{Quot}_p$ 使用 [[16-df-quotient-type]]；$I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$、$R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}$、$q:I\\to Q$。"}],"outgoing":["478c99d853e13c93","93b3305f115fb8fd"]}